  "description": "📡 InkandNeon 📡 InkandNeon is an original, episodic sci-fi horror and cyberpunk audio drama anthology set in the vast, industrial future of 4040. Every week, we decrypt a new transmission—recovering standalone stories, lost surveillance logs, and buried anomalies from the blind spots of a rapidly expanding world. What you'll find in the archive: • To Strike A God: The Full Audiobook Experience (Coming Soon) • Sci-Fi Logs: Isolated incidents of transhuman experiments gone wrong • Final testimonies and dark corporate fragments • Documents of long-buried secrets from Coral City, the Trenches, and beyond 📡 New frequencies broadcast every Wednesday at 8:00 PM AWST. 📡 Every entry is manually scripted, voiced, and mixed by a human creator. Step past the firewall, explore the community hub over on YouTube, or patch through to the terminal link below with feedback, critique, or story contributions: 📨 InkandNeon.piratestation@outlook.com",
